 Err_test;E;msg
 E←Lib.Err
 11 ExpectError 'E.Fail ''bad input'''
 11 ExpectError '''Ctx'' E.Fail ''bad input'''
 5 ExpectError '5 E.Signal ''lengths differ'''
 11 ExpectError '''qty must be > 0'' E.Assert 1 0 1'
 ExpectTrue 'fine' E.Assert 1 1
 :Trap 11
     'MySQLExec' E.Fail 'lost connection'
 :Else
     msg←E.Text ⍬
 :EndTrap
 'DOMAIN ERROR: MySQLExec: lost connection' ExpectEq msg
 :Trap 11
     'qty must be > 0' E.Assert 0
 :Else
     msg←E.Text ⍬
 :EndTrap
 'DOMAIN ERROR: qty must be > 0' ExpectEq msg
 0 ExpectEq 0({÷⍵}E.Try)0
 0.5 ExpectEq 0({÷⍵}E.Try)2
 ⍬ ExpectEq({1 2+⍵}E.Try)1 2 3
